---
// Reading progress under the header: a rose line pushed by a ball, following the scroll (site.js). Decorative.
---
<div class="ds-scroll-progress" aria-hidden="true" data-scroll-progress hidden>
  <span class="ds-scroll-progress__line" data-scroll-line></span>
  <span class="ds-scroll-progress__ball" data-scroll-ball></span>
</div>
